+// The published exception: no eat delay (`^td_flesh_eat_delay` = 0), so the
+// flesh neither reads nor sets the food timer
+// (player/scripts/consumption/consume_shared.rs2). This used to say
+// `p_delay(^td_flesh_eat_delay)`, and a p_delay(0) is still a one-tick park
