+// The pies whose second half keeps the first half's 1-tick eat delay
+// (Template:Fast foods table: dragonfruit, wild and summer pie "1,1"; the
+// redberry, meat and apple pies are "1,2"). Garden, fish, botanical, mushroom
+// and admiral pies are 1,1 too but have no food_table row here, so cannot be
+// eaten at all yet.
+[proc,food_pie_fast_half](obj $food)(boolean)
